      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أزّج</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَأْزِيجٌ</span>, (Msb, K,) <i>He built</i> a
structure of the kind called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَزَجٌ</span>, <i>and made</i> it <i>long:</i>
(K:) or <i>he built</i> a house, or chamber, <i>in the
form of what is so called.</i> (Msb.)

